OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer 'stable and with family'
OL,4,Aafter shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who was shot in
OL,7,FNottingham is "stable" in hospital and
OL,8,Fwith his family, the city's police and
OL,9,Fcrime commissioner (PCC) has said.
OL,11,FThe Nottinghamshire Police officer was
OL,12,Fshot after he approached two people
OL,13,Facting suspiciously in Angel Row
OL,14,Fshortly before 04:50 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FOn Monday, PCC Gary Godden commended
OL,17,Fthe officer's bravery, and said work
OL,18,Fwas ongoing to establish why the
OL,19,Fshooting had occurred. A search is
OL,20,Fstill ongoing for two suspects, a man
OL,21,Fand a woman who fled the scene.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
